  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/669/669-68.htm",
  "statuteText": "669:68 Town Auditors. –\n\nVacancies in the office of town auditor shall be filled by appointment made by the supervisors of the checklist. If a supervisor is also the town treasurer, he shall abstain from the decision on the appointment, and the other supervisors shall make the appointment."
